(7633781, 1238079, 163081, '<td valign="top">Went there many time, but never at night. The Higashiyama district is one of those iconic places to take typical Japanese pictures. Yasaka-no-Tou centered in your image is the strongest way to give it a powerful impact. I would have cloned out that green thing in the center left part. Anyhow, love it.I give you an 8 and my Red Dragon award<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173262" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Went there many time, but never at night. The Higashiyama district is one of those iconic places to take typical Japanese pictures. Yasaka-no-Tou centered in your image is the strongest way to give it a powerful impact. I would have cloned out that green thing in the center left part. Anyhow, love it.I give you an 8 and my Red Dragon award', '2019-06-28 11:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
