(7633793, 1237906, 30861, '<td valign="top">None of my favorite places in Switzerland :-) Spent a summer in a camp above Montreux while the parents were home on "home leave", this would have been 1959 I think :-) Fine B/W.</td>', 'None of my favorite places in Switzerland :-) Spent a summer in a camp above Montreux while the parents were home on "home leave", this would have been 1959 I think :-) Fine B/W.', '2019-06-28 14:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
