(7634101, 1238142, 182284, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I wish I could really enlarge these photos in order to see the beautiful detail up close. I love the patina on the domes. The architecture is beautiful.</td>', 'Sometimes I wish I could really enlarge these photos in order to see the beautiful detail up close. I love the patina on the domes. The architecture is beautiful.', '2019-07-03 02:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634102, 1238126, 182284, '<td valign="top">Amazing cliff dwellings. Good capture.</td>', 'Amazing cliff dwellings. Good capture.', '2019-07-03 02:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634103, 1238139, 182284, '<td valign="top">I love light houses and wish you could have gotten closer or taken it landscape. I love how you caught the reflection of the lighthouse in the water. The boulders are the first thing I see then the lighthouse. Very clean shot.</td>', 'I love light houses and wish you could have gotten closer or taken it landscape. I love how you caught the reflection of the lighthouse in the water. The boulders are the first thing I see then the lighthouse. Very clean shot.', '2019-07-03 02:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634105, 1237963, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very unusual roof line, this may be a spectacular photo with a drone.</td>', 'Very unusual roof line, this may be a spectacular photo with a drone.', '2019-07-03 02:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634106, 1238118, 182284, '<td valign="top">This truly is a gorgeous Music Hall. The black and white really doesn''t do it justice. I think if I had taken this photo I would have taken in color or adjusted the contrast more.</td>', 'This truly is a gorgeous Music Hall. The black and white really doesn''t do it justice. I think if I had taken this photo I would have taken in color or adjusted the contrast more.', '2019-07-03 02:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634107, 1238124, 182284, '<td valign="top">The only thing I may have done is crop just a tad bit to show off that beautiful structure. Truly amazing structure.</td>', 'The only thing I may have done is crop just a tad bit to show off that beautiful structure. Truly amazing structure.', '2019-07-03 02:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634108, 1238070, 182284, '<td valign="top">History may repeat it''s self but all the Kings men and all the king''s horses could not put Humpty Dumpty back together again. This is a lovely structure and nice angle for the composition. Good job.</td>', 'History may repeat it''s self but all the Kings men and all the king''s horses could not put Humpty Dumpty back together again. This is a lovely structure and nice angle for the composition. Good job.', '2019-07-03 02:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
